graph TB
    subgraph ModuleOperator["MCP Lifecycle Module Operator"]
        direction TB
        Reconciler["MCPLifecycleOperator<br/>Reconciler"]
        ManifestRenderer["Manifest Renderer<br/>(kustomize + embed.FS)"]
        SSADeployer["SSA Deployer<br/>(server-side apply)"]
        GarbageCollector["Garbage Collector<br/>(stale resource cleanup)"]
        ConversionChecker["Conversion Health<br/>Checker"]
        TLSResolver["TLS Profile<br/>Resolver"]
        GatewayDiscovery["Gateway Discovery<br/>(dynamic watches)"]
        StorageMigration["Storage Version<br/>Migration"]

        Reconciler --> ManifestRenderer
        Reconciler --> SSADeployer
        Reconciler --> GarbageCollector
        Reconciler --> ConversionChecker
        Reconciler --> TLSResolver
        Reconciler --> GatewayDiscovery
        Reconciler --> StorageMigration
        ManifestRenderer --> SSADeployer
    end

    PlatformOperator["ODH Platform Operator"] -->|creates| MCPLifecycleOperatorCR["MCPLifecycleOperator CR<br/>(Cluster-scoped, name=default)"]
    MCPLifecycleOperatorCR -->|watched by| Reconciler

    Reconciler -->|deploys via SSA| Operand["mcp-lifecycle-operator<br/>(Operand Deployment)"]
    TLSResolver -->|reads| APIServerCR["OpenShift APIServer CR"]

    subgraph OperandResources["Operand-Managed Resources"]
        direction TB
        MCPServerCR["MCPServer CR<br/>(mcp.x-k8s.io)"]
        MCPGatewayBindingCR["MCPGatewayBinding CR<br/>(mcp.x-k8s.io)"]
        WebhookConfig["ValidatingWebhookConfiguration"]
        ServiceMonitorRes["ServiceMonitor"]
    end

    Operand -->|manages| MCPServerCR
    Operand -->|manages| MCPGatewayBindingCR
    ConversionChecker -->|lists at v1beta1| MCPServerCR

    GatewayDiscovery -->|discovers| MCPGatewayExt["MCPGatewayExtension CR<br/>(mcp.kuadrant.io)"]
    GatewayDiscovery -->|discovers| GatewayCR["Gateway CR<br/>(gateway.networking.k8s.io)"]

    Reconciler -->|depends on| PlatformUtils["odh-platform-utilities<br/>(Go library)"]
    Reconciler -->|creates| CertManagerCert["cert-manager Certificate"]

    style Reconciler fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style ManifestRenderer fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style SSADeployer fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style GarbageCollector fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style ConversionChecker fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style TLSResolver fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style GatewayDiscovery fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style StorageMigration fill:#4a90e2,color:#fff
    style MCPLifecycleOperatorCR fill:#f5a623,color:#000
    style MCPServerCR fill:#f5a623,color:#000
    style MCPGatewayBindingCR fill:#f5a623,color:#000
    style Operand fill:#7ed321,color:#000
    style PlatformOperator fill:#e8e8e8,color:#000
    style APIServerCR fill:#e8e8e8,color:#000
    style MCPGatewayExt fill:#e8e8e8,color:#000
    style GatewayCR fill:#e8e8e8,color:#000
    style PlatformUtils fill:#7ed321,color:#000
    style CertManagerCert fill:#e8e8e8,color:#000
